OL,3,ASupreme Court rejects Trump's request
OL,4,Ato stop California counting disputed
OL,5,Avotes
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe US Supreme Court has rejected a
OL,8,Flast-minute request by the Trump
OL,9,Fadministration asking it to intervene
OL,10,Fin California's midterm election vote
OL,11,Fcount.
OL,13,FThe justice department wanted 20,000
OL,14,Fballots to be set aside that it alleged
OL,15,Fmay have been issued to non-US citizens
OL,16,Fin the state.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
